@TeamTaskBoard.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5159

GET {{TeamTaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

# Set this to a Firebase ID token for the authenticated requests below.
@firebaseIdToken = replace-with-firebase-id-token

### Verify a missing token (expected 401)
GET {{TeamTaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify

### Verify a Firebase ID token (expected 200 for a valid token)
GET {{TeamTaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}

### Synchronize a profile (expected 200; repeat safely to verify idempotency)
POST {{TeamTaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Example User"
}

### Get the authenticated profile (expected 200)
GET {{TeamTaskBoard.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{firebaseIdToken}}
